.TH SWAYDESK-NOTIFICATIONS 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.5" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-notifications \- notification icon for Waybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-notifications
.br
.B swaydesk\-notifications
toggle\-dnd
.SH DESCRIPTION
Without arguments, a Waybar custom module (custom/notification): it prints one JSON line on every change of the notification list and of Do Not Disturb, read from swaydesk\-notifd, and reconnects when the daemon restarts.
.PP
The session runs it under the name waybar\-notifications (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-notifications); the process name is waybar\-notifications too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B toggle\-dnd
Turn Do Not Disturb on or off and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR swaydesk\-notifd (1),
.BR swaydesk\-notifications\-popup (1),
.BR waybar (5)
